&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Team Pegasus, responsible for the Awin Mobile App and its backend platform. Pegasus is part of the Publisher Tribe that builds the experiences publishers rely on every day: discovering opportunities, generating links, tracking performance, and growing their partnerships on the go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is focused primarily on the creator-focused mobile app. You will lead two teams that bring it to life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pegasus Mobile&lt;/strong&gt;, building our Flutter-based mobile application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pegasus Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, providing the APIs and backend services that power the mobile app and our publisher web experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a leadership role, not a hands-on coding role, but we expect strong technical depth so you can guide the team and unblock delivery when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Tasks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor engineers, fostering their growth and career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive recruitment efforts and ensure successful onboarding for new team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct performance reviews, track individual development plans, and provide regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Product Manager to define team objectives and OKRs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the team to take ownership of the software delivery lifecycle and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate discussions and decision-making processes within the team, resolving conflicts when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Product, UX and other engineering teams to deliver on shared goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI-assisted development, code generation and agentic coding workflows to accelerate delivery across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to knowledge sharing and promote a culture of learning within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the strategic direction of the Engineering Management group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years of experience as an Engineering Manager, Technical Lead or equivalent leadership position, with a clear servant-leadership and empowering management style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on experience building and shipping mobile applications in a commercial setting, ideally apps you have helped launch and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product mindset, comfortable collaborating with Product and UX on discovery and shaping outcomes, not just executing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend and cloud literacy sufficient to lead the Platform team (backend, API, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted development, code generation and agentic coding workflows to accelerate delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator across technical and non-technical audiences, comfortable adopting language based on the room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in an Agile setup (Scrum or Kanban), facilitating ceremonies and supporting the team through change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Flutter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product experience in the creator economy, for example creator tooling, affiliate or creator monetisation platforms, or influencer-facing products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience orchestrating multi-agent AI workflows for engineering or product use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid/remote working scheme which is designed to foster a culture of mutual trust and working flexibility.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace when working from home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: With our support and access to various initiatives and sports offers, you can focus on your mental and physical wellbeing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve built our extensive training suite, Awin Academy, to cover a wide range of skills that support your professional and personal growth, with trainings conveniently packaged to help your overall development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appreciation&lt;/strong&gt;: Thank and reward colleagues by sending them a voucher through our peer-to-peer recognition programme.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are hiring in multiple countries for this role. Additional benefits, including health and wellbeing offerings, will be discussed during the initial interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 2000, Awin is proud of our dynamic, social and inclusive culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Like all businesses, we’ve had to adapt and nurture our culture in a virtual environment. Our virtual ‘Life @ Awin’ hub brings our colleagues from across the globe together for various social activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion are paramount to us, and we proudly pursue and hire diverse team members. We champion uniqueness and authenticity; this is who we are at our core. Our network of affiliate partnerships are diverse and transparent, as are the employees powering our vision to build the world’s leading open partner ecosystem. We welcome all backgrounds, identities, and experiences. If you need support at any point in the application or interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;Awin is part of the Axel Springer group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axelspringer.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;axelspringer.com/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;en&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;, and explore the Axel Springer Essentials here:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now to begin the next stage of your career at a progressive company that supports both your professional and personal development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-RS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members: 900,000 UK and 1,100,000 in India and growing rapidly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2,800 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised with Great Place to Work certification three years in a row, and among India’s Top 50 Best Workplaces in Banking, Financial Services, and Insurance in 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will become part of a dedicated and dynamic team that drives Tide&#39;s market success in Germany. The Tide Germany team is in an exciting growth phase and unites experts with profound knowledge in the fields of financial services, technology, and local market understanding. As part of this expanding team, you will receive the unique opportunity to help shape Tide&#39;s presence in Germany and jointly deliver innovative solutions for small businesses. Partner Credit Services is Tide&#39;s SME loan platform. By collaborating with credit partners, Partner Credit Services connects business owners with the appropriate financing – for founders who want to take their business to the next level, for entrepreneurs who are holding their own in a difficult market, and for executives who want to adapt their strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Platform Operations Specialist, you will be the operational backbone of Tide&#39;s SME loan platform and the bridge between our sales, product, and engineering teams. Our platform works to match business owners with the most appropriate lenders for their finance applications, and its performance depends on the integrations behind it working reliably and converting effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own platform-driven revenue and the relationships with the lenders integrated into it. That means knowing our conversion numbers better than anyone, spotting where the platform is leaking value, and turning that insight into product changes and new initiatives that grow revenue and improve the customer experience. It also means owning the operational detail - monthly revenue reconciliation, incident response, and the reporting that leadership relies on to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;YOUR RESPONSIBILITIES INCLUDE:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You own the performance of platform-driven revenue and will play a key role in us achieving the revenue target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lender Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; You work hand-in-hand with the partnerships team to manage day-to-day relationships with the lenders integrated with the platform and work with them to improve conversion, decisioning and payout performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;You identify any areas of focus, build the case for change, and work with Product and Engineering to turn those ideas into shipped improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Reconciliation:&lt;/strong&gt; You support the monthly reconciliation of all platform and sales revenue, ensuring accuracy and resolving discrepancies with lenders and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting and Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; You report and present platform performance from our Salesforce CRM to the commercial team and senior stakeholders, with a clear view of what is driving the numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboards and Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; You build effective dashboards and performance tracking tools that guide business decisions rather than just describe the past.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimisation:&lt;/strong&gt; You identify and implement process improvements that increase operational efficiency and conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Management and Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; You monitor, diagnose and troubleshoot complex platform issues, drive them to resolution with Product and Engineering, and support post-incident reviews and root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;You work closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, Partnerships, Finance and Member Support to keep the platform commercially and operationally healthy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4 years of experience in a platform operations, revenue operations or business operations role, ideally within financial services, lending or fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Salesforce CRM skills - you can build reports and dashboards, understand the underlying data model, and maintain data quality without waiting for someone else to do it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with Product and Engineering teams: writing clear requirements, prioritising, and a basic understanding of how integrations and APIs behave in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable diagnosing and troubleshooting operational and technical issues, and running or supporting root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly numerate and analytical, with strong attention to detail - reconciliation accuracy matters in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, able to influence lenders, internal stakeholders and senior leadership with equal credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent &lt;strong&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt; are a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, self-motivated approach, always working backwards from the goal to ensure effective implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to work effectively through ambiguity and competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DeutschlandTicket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sports Club Membership M&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days paid vacation per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional 3 days paid leave for voluntary work or further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We invest in your professional development with a dedicated budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 weeks sabbatical (after 3 years of tenure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support through Plumm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-time home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;TIDEAN WAYS OF WORKING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Business Performance Team&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to enable seamless, secure connectivity between healthcare systems by building and scaling Doctolib&#39;s self-service integration platform; making system integrations effortless and accessible to healthcare providers across every market we operate in, from a single platform rather than country by country.. You will lead a hybrid team working on the technical backbone that powers Doctolib&#39;s international expansion, contributing directly to reducing integration time by 75% and unlocking 500+ certified integrations for 400K+ health professionals and 80M+ patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; a hybrid team of ~8 engineers (internal employees and contractors), growing internal talent while holding contractors accountable for delivery, and shaping how the two work together as the platform scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end delivery of integration projects on the&amp;nbsp; platform, ensuring reliability, scalability, and building to national interoperability standards with full compliance to healthcare standards (HL7, FHIR R5/R6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt; backend architecture decisions in a JVM-focused stack (Java, Kotlin), championing FHIR-native design and interoperability best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; integrations as a platform that scales across partners, countries and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; with Product, and cross-market engineering teams across France, Germany, and Italy to align on platform priorities and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion&lt;/strong&gt; AI adoption within the team, enabling MCP-native patterns and AI-assisted integration tooling as part of Doctolib&#39;s platform strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; and grow internal engineers, while maintaining high delivery standards and engagement with your full team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least &lt;strong&gt;6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of software engineering experience and &lt;strong&gt;3+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of engineering management experience, including leading &lt;strong&gt;large or hybrid teams&lt;/strong&gt; (internal engineers + contractors), ideally 8+ people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong background in &lt;strong&gt;backend and system-to-system integration&lt;/strong&gt;: APIs, middleware, and healthcare data exchanges, with hands-on familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;JVM ecosystems (Java, Kotlin)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with &lt;strong&gt;healthcare IT integrations&lt;/strong&gt;, including standards such as HL7 and FHIR, and working within regulated, compliance-driven regulated environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can differentiate your management approach between &lt;strong&gt;developing internal engineers&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;driving delivery from external contractor profiles&lt;/strong&gt;, with proven success in both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have exposure to AI tooling in engineering workflows: coding agents, LLM-assisted development, or MCP-native patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have delivered products across &lt;strong&gt;multiple countries or international markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Deutschlandticket (Germany-wide public transport pass) fully paid for by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;28 vacation days + 1 additional day for each full calendar year of employment (up to a maximum of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company health insurance with great supplementary benefits through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme (bAV) through Allianz with an employer subsidy of 40% (15% within the probationary period)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Doctolib Parent Care program, which includes one month additional parental leave and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized sports membership through our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy offering both hybrid and office-based mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alongside healthy snacks and our regular breakfast buffet, we provide a subsidized meal benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EM Case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;candidate experience page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech stack: Java, Kotlin, Ruby&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Berlin, Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 3 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
